sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest without certificateType

    CSMS->>CS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsRequest (certificateType omitted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateType is omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: GetInstalledCertificateIdsResponse (status = Accepted, certificateHashDataChain = hashData of all certificates stored at the Test System truststore)
